  {
   "caption": "YOUR PHONE / HAS SPRINGS",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.33,
   "first_word_s": 0.05,
   "last_word_s": 0.53,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.05,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Microscopic ones.",
   "start": 1.33,
   "end": 2.71,
   "first_word_s": 1.4,
   "last_word_s": 1.84,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "So how do they know / which way is down?",
   "start": 2.71,
   "end": 4.93,
   "first_word_s": 2.78,
   "last_word_s": 4.3,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "In a chip, a tiny weight / hangs on springs.",
   "start": 4.93,
   "end": 7.48,
   "first_word_s": 5.0,
   "last_word_s": 6.64,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Gravity tugs on it,",
   "start": 7.48,
   "end": 8.58,
   "first_word_s": 7.55,
   "last_word_s": 8.35,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "so it shifts slightly.",
   "start": 8.58,
   "end": 9.88,
   "first_word_s": 8.65,
   "last_word_s": 9.05,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Its fingers move closer / to one set of plates,",
   "start": 9.88,
   "end": 12.42,
   "first_word_s": 9.95,
   "last_word_s": 11.77,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "and the chip measures / that change.",
   "start": 12.42,
   "end": 14.48,
   "first_word_s": 12.49,
   "last_word_s": 13.65,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Turn the phone sideways,",
   "start": 14.48,
   "end": 16.18,
   "first_word_s": 14.55,
   "last_word_s": 15.03,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "and the weight shifts another way, / so the screen turns.",
   "start": 16.18,
   "end": 20.38,
   "first_word_s": 16.25,
   "last_word_s": 18.17,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "Reading in bed / on your side?",
   "start": 20.38,
   "end": 22.2,
   "first_word_s": 20.45,
   "last_word_s": 21.39,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "The weight still / feels gravity,",
   "start": 22.2,
   "end": 23.86,
   "first_word_s": 22.27,
   "last_word_s": 23.13,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
  {
   "caption": "so lock rotation.",
   "start": 23.86,
   "end": 26.38,
   "first_word_s": 23.93,
   "last_word_s": 24.15,
   "caption_lead_s": 0.07,
   "ok": true,
   "spoken": true
  },
